# Local env
.env

# GitHub Actions workflows — the GitHub App used for automated commits
# lacks the `workflows` permission to push .github/workflows/*
# (re-confirmed empirically 2026-07: git push → remote rejected; the
# contents API → 403). Workflows are managed manually by repository
# owners with full access; the ready-to-install workflow lives at
# docs/ci/ci.yml.
.github/
